// =====================================================================
// EGRESS-SAVER PATCH for the Purchase FMS import script
//
// How to apply (in the Apps Script editor of the import project):
//   1. DELETE these old functions:  getFullTable, importAllSteps,
//      installHourlyTrigger.
//   2. PASTE everything below this header into the project (new file or
//      bottom of the existing one).
//   3. Replace the body of sbFetchAllRaw with the version below
//      (same name, it is redefined here, so delete the old one too).
//   4. Run menu "Remove Auto-Refresh", then run installSixHourlyTrigger once.
//
// What it changes:
//   - Only the columns the import code actually reads are downloaded
//     (no more select=*). Missing columns are dropped automatically.
//   - Run time budget (5 min) so Apps Script's 6 min limit never kills a run
//     half-way, and a lock so two runs never overlap.
//   - Egress is measured: every run logs MB downloaded and request count.
//   - Trigger runs every 6 hours instead of hourly (4x fewer downloads).
//   - Works from a time trigger (the old importAllSteps threw on getUi()).
// =====================================================================

